## MedSync Core

### Description
MedSync Core is our flagship care coordination platform that enables healthcare organizations to synchronize patient data across systems, automate clinical workflows, and improve care team collaboration.

### Key Features

| Feature | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| Patient Hub | 360-degree patient view across all encounters |
| Care Plans | Configurable care plan templates and tracking |
| Task Management | Clinical task assignment and workflows |
| Alerts & Notifications | Real-time clinical alerts |
| Documentation | Structured note templates |
| EHR Integration | Bi-directional sync with 100+ EHR systems |

### Technical Specifications

| Specification | Details |
|---------------|---------|
| Deployment | Cloud (AWS), on-premise available |
| Uptime SLA | 99.95% |
| Data Refresh | Real-time (streaming) |
| API | RESTful, HL7 FHIR |
| Security | HIPAA, SOC 2 Type II, HITRUST |

### Pricing

| Tier | Monthly per Provider | Includes |
|------|---------------------|----------|
| Standard | $350 | Core features, 3 integrations |
| Professional | $550 | + Advanced workflows, 10 integrations |
| Enterprise | Custom | + Dedicated support, unlimited integrations |

